{{also|Fett}}
==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gml|de}} {{m|gml|vet}}, from {{etyl|osx|de}} {{m|osx|*fētid}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*faitidaz}}. Compare [[High German]] {{m|de|feist}} from the same root.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/fɛt/|lang=de}}

===Adjective===
{{de-adj|er|fettesten}}

# [[fat]]
#: '''''Fette''' Menschen sind oft ungesund.''
#:: '''Fat''' people are often unhealthy.
# {{lb|de|of food}} [[rich]], containing a lot of fat
# {{lb|de|typography}} [[bold]]
#: ''In diesem Satz ist nur das Wort „'''fett'''“ '''fett''' geschrieben.''
#:: ''In this sentence, only the the word "'''bold'''" is written in '''bold'''.''
# {{label|de|colloquial}} [[awesome]], [[phat]]
#: ''Das war echt '''fett'''.''
#:: This was really '''awesome'''.
#: ''Sie hat 'nen '''fetten''' Vertrag an Land gezogen.''
#:: She got a very '''profitable''' contract.

